# Vraska Joins Up: "When Vraska Joins Up enters, put a deathtouch counter on each creature you control" (CR 122.1b) and "Whenever a
# legendary creature you control deals combat damage to a player, draw a card" (CR 510.2). Turn 1: Bot1's legendary Isamaru and
# nonlegendary Memnite each get a counter, and so does nothing of Bot2's (turn 2: its Isamaru, also legendary, and Memnite come after
# the counters are put on). Turn 3: Isamaru and Memnite hit Bot2, and only the legendary one draws (hand: 1 left over, the turn's draw,
